---
title: "I stopped rebuilding the site and started closing"
description: "I was hiding in design work when I should have been on calls."
date: "2026-07-26"
tags:
  - founding
  - algility
published: true
layout: docs
---

For a while I'd open Figma every time sales felt awkward. New section. New color. New "positioning." It felt like progress. It wasn't.

The week I forced myself to stop touching the Algility site and just take conversations, things moved. Not because the brand got better. Because people finally heard the offer out loud.

I still care how things look. I just don't let the homepage become a place to hide from the phone.
